{
  "$schema": "./bin-manifest.schema.json",
  "$comment": "Single source of truth for CPQ plugin CLI bin entries. Read by build.ts, health-check.mjs, and sync-workbuddy.ts. Do NOT edit bin lists in those files directly — update this file instead.",
  "entries": [
    {
      "name": "cpq",
      "source": "cpq-command",
      "entryFile": "cli-entry.js",
      "healthCheck": true,
      "group": "cpq-bin",
      "usageHint": ""
    },
    {
      "name": "tcloud-price",
      "source": "cpq-command",
      "entryFile": "tcloud-price-entry.js",
      "healthCheck": true,
      "group": "cpq-bin",
      "usageHint": "仅作 D 段询价 ② 兜底 + 查产品规格 schema/help；禁止直接用于询价，也禁止用它去『验证地域是否存在』（地域可售性看 cloud-mapping 字典 + 问用户）。询价主入口 = use_skill inquiry-price（内核默认 knot），须先经 ① 未命中方可降级到本工具"
    },
    {
      "name": "command-auth",
      "source": "cpq-command",
      "entryFile": "command-auth-entry.js",
      "healthCheck": true,
      "group": "cpq-bin",
      "usageHint": ""
    },
    {
      "name": "reason",
      "source": "cpq-command",
      "entryFile": "reason-entry.js",
      "healthCheck": true,
      "group": "reason-bash"
    },
    {
      "name": "oagent",
      "source": "cpq-command",
      "entryFile": "oplus-entry.js",
      "healthCheck": true,
      "group": "cpq-bin"
    },
    {
      "name": "health-check",
      "source": "local",
      "entryFile": "health-check.mjs",
      "healthCheck": false,
      "group": "cpq-bin"
    }
  ],
  "healthCheckExtras": {
    "$comment": "Additional environment checks beyond CLI tools. SSOT for health-check.mjs.",
    "cliNotes": [
      "询价能力主入口 = use_skill inquiry-price（wrapper · 内核默认 knot）；tcloud-price 只是无 SPUID 行的 ② 兜底，须先经 ① 未命中才降级，切勿直接裸调用于询价或地域可售性验证。"
    ],
    "pythonDeps": ["openpyxl", "requests", "pandas"],
    "fileChecks": [],
    "networkChecks": [
      {
        "name": "panshi.woa.com",
        "host": "panshi.woa.com",
        "port": 443
      },
      {
        "name": "cpq.woa.com",
        "host": "cpq.woa.com",
        "port": 443
      },
      {
        "name": "dev.ba.woa.com",
        "host": "dev.ba.woa.com",
        "port": 443
      }
    ]
  }
}
